---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Story" description="How Olive Branch Coffee Co. started in Moreno Valley, CA.">
  <section class="section max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold">Rooted in the neighborhood</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-2xl bg-olive-200"></div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-olive-700">
      <p>
        Olive Branch Coffee Co. opened its doors in Moreno Valley with one idea: coffee is
        better when it's unhurried, and a neighborhood is better when it has a place to gather.
      </p>
      <p>
        We source from small roasters we trust, bake what we can in-house, and try to know
        most of our regulars by name — and their order, too.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of the counter, we host latte art nights, roaster tastings, and seasonal
        pop-ups, and we open our space for private events and catering. If you'd like to
        bring your own gathering here, visit our <a href="/events" class="font-medium text-clay-500 hover:text-clay-600">events page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
